WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:09.860
It has been ten years since the great 
sage Alabaster gave his prophecy.

00:10.300 --> 00:13.270
How we have waited for this day.

00:23.640 --> 00:25.170
Almost got it...

00:27.070 --> 00:28.040
Whoa!

00:34.800 --> 00:36.180
What is this?

00:37.960 --> 00:39.290
Are they aliens?

00:41.760 --> 00:43.270
It's a girl!

00:45.240 --> 00:46.230
Boy...

00:46.690 --> 00:48.190
What is your name?

00:48.550 --> 00:51.070
I... I'm Satou.

00:51.600 --> 00:54.030
I see. What an odd name.

00:54.680 --> 00:59.160
My name is, uh... Hime Nokana.

00:59.490 --> 01:00.590
Hime?

01:01.110 --> 01:06.000
Satou, you cannot tell anyone 
what you saw here.

01:06.700 --> 01:08.710
In fact, please forget all about it.

01:10.670 --> 01:12.890
In exchange,

01:13.650 --> 01:16.000
I will be your friend.

01:20.890 --> 01:22.410
<i>Back then,</i>

01:23.090 --> 01:24.790
<i>young as I was,</i>

01:26.020 --> 01:29.690
<i>I felt that I had to protect 
this girl in front of me.</i>

01:31.100 --> 01:32.950
<i>And somehow,</i>

01:32.950 --> 01:37.050
<i>I knew that it would have to be 
for a long, long time.</i>

03:10.590 --> 03:13.670
<b>Ten Years Later</b>

03:19.120 --> 03:20.660
Good morning, Satou.

03:23.040 --> 03:23.970
Hime...

03:24.740 --> 03:25.930
Morning.

03:26.240 --> 03:28.390
Breakfast's ready.

03:31.170 --> 03:33.660
Bit early for a feast, isn't it?

03:33.660 --> 03:37.570
School's out after today, 
so I woke up early and excited.

03:38.190 --> 03:42.620
<i>Hime—Himeno Nonaka and 
I have been friends since we were kids.</i>

03:44.140 --> 03:47.910
<i>It's been ten years since 
she moved in next door.</i>

03:49.570 --> 03:54.230
<i>Her parents don't seem to be around, 
and she lives with her grandpa.</i>

03:56.800 --> 04:00.500
Y'know, you've changed a lot 
since we started high school.

04:00.880 --> 04:04.050
You used to keep a lower profile before.

04:04.370 --> 04:10.020
Well, it only made me stick out even more, 
what with my blonde hair and all.

04:10.420 --> 04:13.510
Besides, I'm "Hime," a princess!

04:13.510 --> 04:15.130
I need to be strong!

04:15.130 --> 04:17.890
What's with that? 
You've been saying it for years.

04:21.360 --> 04:23.320
Wait, what?

04:29.400 --> 04:30.570
Hime?

04:34.340 --> 04:35.120
Rice on your face.

04:51.080 --> 04:52.750
Hey, Grandpa.

04:54.550 --> 04:56.730
Good morning, Hime's grandpa.

04:56.730 --> 04:58.820
Good morning, Satou.

04:59.230 --> 05:01.120
We're heading out.

05:01.120 --> 05:02.760
Have a nice day.

05:05.530 --> 05:08.430
Is your dad not coming home yet?

05:08.430 --> 05:10.910
Probably not until the end of summer break.

05:10.910 --> 05:12.570
You sure have it rough.

05:12.570 --> 05:14.000
I'm used to it.

05:18.820 --> 05:20.290
These rings?

05:21.000 --> 05:25.010
I'll give one to the person I marry. 
They're really important to me.

05:25.940 --> 05:27.280
Say, Satou...

05:28.670 --> 05:30.790
When we grow up,

05:31.440 --> 05:33.000
will you marry me?

05:35.360 --> 05:36.440
What is it?

05:37.140 --> 05:38.350
You can't have these.

05:40.200 --> 05:42.050
They're really important to me.

05:46.050 --> 05:50.490
<i>Oh, well. That's usually 
how childhood promises go.</i>

05:51.170 --> 05:53.230
Hurry up! We're gonna be late!

05:53.230 --> 05:54.930
C-Coming.

05:56.900 --> 05:58.550
How'd you do on the finals?

05:58.550 --> 06:00.580
Couldn't have gone worse.

06:00.580 --> 06:02.110
Ta-da!

06:02.110 --> 06:05.320
Wow, Hime! You're so smart!

06:05.320 --> 06:09.430
Heh, heh. A princess needs 
to be smart, as well.

06:09.430 --> 06:10.940
There it is.

06:10.940 --> 06:13.140
Again, of what country?

06:13.140 --> 06:16.780
Summer break starts tomorrow, 
and I'm all alone!

06:17.460 --> 06:18.880
You're so lucky, Satou.

06:18.880 --> 06:20.300
Look at your chill aura.

06:20.300 --> 06:22.260
Guys with girlfriends are different.

06:23.000 --> 06:27.280
I mean Nonaka! Don't think I don't see you 
coming to school together every day!

06:27.280 --> 06:30.240
We're just neighbors, dude.

06:30.850 --> 06:35.010
Listen, man. Don't get too 
comfortable with the status quo.

06:35.620 --> 06:39.310
Right? When you finally get off your ass 
and make a move, it might be too late.

06:39.310 --> 06:42.300
If I had a girl that cute around, 
I'd already be with her.

06:41.750 --> 06:44.750
<b></b>Hime

06:41.750 --> 06:44.750
<b></b>\h\h\h\hSummer Festival
\h\h\hLet's go to the summer
\h\hfestival after school.
\hMeet in front of the
shrine at 6:30.

06:42.300 --> 06:45.480
I dunno, she's a little too flashy for me.

06:44.750 --> 06:46.530
Why a text?

06:45.480 --> 06:47.840
Then what <i>is</i> your type?

06:47.840 --> 06:50.470
I'm more into the quiet, refined girls.

06:51.570 --> 06:54.010
<i>Uh, maybe...</i>

06:54.340 --> 06:56.090
<i>I can get my hopes up?</i>

07:00.420 --> 07:01.500
Hime!

07:03.830 --> 07:05.000
Whoa, a yukata?

07:05.860 --> 07:07.110
What's this?

07:07.110 --> 07:08.710
Did I take your breath away?

07:08.710 --> 07:11.010
K-Kinda, I guess?

07:12.570 --> 07:15.790
I-It's good that you're so honest!

07:15.790 --> 07:17.700
Okay, let's go.

07:17.700 --> 07:18.710
Yeah.

07:19.910 --> 07:22.320
<b>Cotton Candy</b>

07:19.910 --> 07:23.880
<b>Buttered Potatoes</b>

07:19.910 --> 07:23.880
<b>Okonomiyaki</b>

07:20.770 --> 07:23.880
Wow, this is great!

07:21.880 --> 07:23.880
<b>Takoyaki</b>

07:23.880 --> 07:26.650
Festivals are so exciting!

07:27.170 --> 07:29.720
Hey, Satou, do you remember?

07:30.760 --> 07:34.680
We came to this festival when 
we were little and got lost.

07:35.320 --> 07:37.930
You said, "This way, we won't 
get separated from each other,"

07:38.400 --> 07:40.820
and held my hand the whole time.

07:41.520 --> 07:44.300
You were my hero back then.

07:44.300 --> 07:46.030
You mean I'm not now?

07:47.050 --> 07:48.400
Who can say?

07:51.430 --> 07:53.320
Anyway, let's get something to eat.

08:01.090 --> 08:02.550
So cute!

08:02.550 --> 08:04.310
Y-You think?

08:08.150 --> 08:11.340
<i>This is how we've always been.</i>

08:12.380 --> 08:14.300
Satou, get that for me!

08:16.350 --> 08:17.190
I'll play.

08:17.190 --> 08:18.810
That'll be 500 yen.

08:21.280 --> 08:23.940
<i>I used to think that I was 
fine with the status quo</i>

08:24.480 --> 08:27.230
<i>if it was between that 
and ruining our friendship.</i>

08:27.900 --> 08:29.020
<i>But now...</i>

08:45.460 --> 08:46.750
<i>I can do this.</i>

08:47.110 --> 08:50.340
<i>The mood's perfect. I think I can do this!</i>

08:51.930 --> 08:54.380
Hey, Hime, I'm in lo—

08:57.220 --> 08:58.800
Beautiful.

09:03.960 --> 09:05.360
I'm so glad

09:05.890 --> 09:07.940
I got to see this with you.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.340
Me, too.

09:18.360 --> 09:19.800
Hey, Satou...

09:21.070 --> 09:25.660
There's something I haven't been 
able to tell you for a while now.

09:26.970 --> 09:28.380
<i>Wait, what?</i>

09:29.040 --> 09:30.220
<i>Could it be...</i>

09:31.340 --> 09:32.780
<i>Could it be?!</i>

09:34.100 --> 09:35.220
I...

09:35.220 --> 09:37.760
<i>Me, too! I'm in...</i>

09:38.410 --> 09:40.180
I'm going to be moving.

09:46.760 --> 09:47.640
Huh?

09:49.820 --> 09:50.750
When?

09:52.570 --> 09:53.660
Tomorrow.

09:55.150 --> 09:58.160
We're going back to Grandpa's homeland.

09:58.820 --> 10:00.560
It's very far away.

10:00.560 --> 10:01.920
No way!

10:05.130 --> 10:07.780
Thanks for tonight, Satou.

10:07.780 --> 10:08.580
Hime...

10:08.580 --> 10:09.460
I...

10:09.460 --> 10:12.110
I'm glad I got to see the fireworks with you.

10:13.000 --> 10:14.640
And the festival...

10:15.420 --> 10:16.800
And this plushie!

10:18.340 --> 10:20.770
Is there no changing this?

10:21.520 --> 10:22.770
Honestly...

10:23.760 --> 10:26.280
I made some amazing memories to take with me.

10:28.190 --> 10:29.320
Goodbye!

10:29.320 --> 10:30.440
Hime!

10:32.910 --> 10:34.150
Hime...

10:37.460 --> 10:39.860
<i>She said it was far away,</i>

10:40.350 --> 10:41.750
<i>but where is she going?</i>

10:43.670 --> 10:48.580
<i>Looking back, I thought I knew her, 
but I actually don't know anything about her.</i>

10:49.250 --> 10:52.050
<i>Even the day I met her.</i>

10:52.730 --> 10:54.080
<i>I feel like...</i>

11:03.490 --> 11:04.720
That's right.

11:05.530 --> 11:09.220
I feel like something really 
strange happened that day!

11:15.670 --> 11:17.130
Hime!

11:19.830 --> 11:21.260
Please don't go!

11:22.770 --> 11:24.380
So you remember.

11:25.710 --> 11:27.300
Then you must understand.

11:28.440 --> 11:30.180
I'm not "moving."

11:30.760 --> 11:34.030
I'm going home to a different world.

11:35.520 --> 11:38.760
You see, I'm getting married.

11:40.580 --> 11:44.600
I'm a princess, after all. It is what it is.

11:44.600 --> 11:46.420
W-Wait!

11:46.420 --> 11:48.850
So this really is it.

11:49.810 --> 11:51.540
Goodbye, Satou.

11:51.980 --> 11:53.400
It's been fun.

11:56.620 --> 11:59.270
Hime!

12:00.630 --> 12:03.490
<i>What did I come here for?</i>

12:03.870 --> 12:06.280
<i>To see Hime off?</i>

12:06.680 --> 12:08.020
<i>Hell no!</i>

12:08.800 --> 12:10.040
<i>In that case...</i>

12:10.710 --> 12:13.040
No point wasting time thinking about it!

12:24.910 --> 12:26.390
Princess of Nokanatika,

12:26.920 --> 12:29.630
Krystal Novaty Nokanatika.

12:29.630 --> 12:33.880
Second prince of Gisaras, 
Marmarugias Gisaras.

12:32.240 --> 12:33.680
Who is that?

12:33.680 --> 12:36.590
Did he follow the princess?

12:33.880 --> 12:36.590
These rings will now bind you.

12:36.590 --> 12:37.470
Where am I?

12:37.470 --> 12:39.520
With a sacred kiss...

12:39.520 --> 12:40.780
Who's there?

12:40.780 --> 12:41.530
Hime!

12:44.890 --> 12:46.450
Satou...

12:47.180 --> 12:48.740
Princess Krystal?

12:48.740 --> 12:49.870
Who is he?

12:53.250 --> 12:54.160
Stand back!

12:55.070 --> 12:56.120
What?

12:56.120 --> 12:57.630
Eek!

12:57.630 --> 12:59.090
A monster from the Abyss!

13:01.340 --> 13:04.650
I knew it. They're after the princess's life.

13:04.650 --> 13:08.330
We were right to hide her in the other world!

13:08.330 --> 13:09.380
Hup!

13:10.140 --> 13:11.710
Hime's grandpa?!

13:11.710 --> 13:13.810
Satou? What are you doing here?!

13:17.350 --> 13:21.360
It appears we really do 
need the Ring of Light...

13:21.360 --> 13:25.070
Krystal! Give the Ring of Light to the prince!

13:26.950 --> 13:28.160
Satou!

13:28.160 --> 13:30.410
This is seriously bad news.

13:34.580 --> 13:35.760
Satou!

13:52.850 --> 13:55.060
What have you done?!

13:55.060 --> 13:57.850
So that's how it is, Princess Krystal.

13:58.160 --> 14:00.020
You there! Use this!

14:01.650 --> 14:04.250
Whoa, a real sword!

14:04.680 --> 14:08.320
That's cool and all, 
but what do I do with it?!

14:08.320 --> 14:09.410
Behind you, Satou!

14:16.410 --> 14:18.490
I don't get it,

14:18.490 --> 14:20.910
but I just gotta do this, right?!

14:26.450 --> 14:27.350
Huh?

14:37.680 --> 14:39.910
Good morning, Satou.

14:41.720 --> 14:43.150
Where are we?

14:43.150 --> 14:44.910
The royal couple's bedroom.

14:44.910 --> 14:46.070
Couple?!

14:46.460 --> 14:49.530
I mean, you remember, right?

14:49.850 --> 14:53.330
We shared a kiss and all.

14:56.950 --> 14:58.700
<i>W-We did!</i>

14:59.040 --> 15:02.600
<i>So Hime really does love me?</i>

15:03.490 --> 15:08.510
I was supposed to marry that prince.

15:09.340 --> 15:12.080
But I don't really know him.

15:12.080 --> 15:14.970
And I didn't wanna marry some stranger.

15:14.970 --> 15:18.480
So when I saw a familiar face, 
I just went for it.

15:18.480 --> 15:19.730
You just what?!

15:20.060 --> 15:21.430
And, well...

15:22.760 --> 15:26.790
Sorry! I chose you to be our hero!

15:27.230 --> 15:29.500
He's the Ring King!

15:29.500 --> 15:31.980
They say he came from another world.

15:31.980 --> 15:33.560
He's amazing!

15:33.560 --> 15:37.040
He sliced that monster in half 
with that sword of light!

15:37.900 --> 15:43.500
That wedding was meant to build a bridge 
between the Kingdom of Light and the Empire.

15:43.500 --> 15:48.170
If the Emperor learns of this, 
he will be furious.

15:48.170 --> 15:53.090
The maiden of the Rings of Light chooses
 the Ring King who will save the world.

15:53.090 --> 15:58.520
He and I merely followed the tradition.

15:59.310 --> 16:03.160
My father's will and the 
Empire's plans have no bearing.

16:03.160 --> 16:06.060
This failure of a second prince 
thinks he knows it all.

16:06.610 --> 16:09.030
Are you finished?

16:09.480 --> 16:15.460
We granted you this audience 
because you all wished to see him.

16:15.460 --> 16:19.890
But there are many others 
waiting for their king.

16:19.890 --> 16:20.730
Tch.

16:21.880 --> 16:24.190
Now, come this way.

16:29.220 --> 16:36.060
I present to you the defeater of the Abyss, 
bringer of light to Arnulus: your Ring King!

16:36.510 --> 16:39.210
Hey, Satou, say something.

16:39.210 --> 16:40.470
What?!

16:41.050 --> 16:44.010
Ring King! Ring King!

16:44.010 --> 16:47.520
They have eagerly awaited 
the return of the Ring King.

16:47.520 --> 16:50.530
You are their greatest hope.

16:50.830 --> 16:52.950
Don't let them down.

16:55.400 --> 16:56.560
I...

16:58.380 --> 16:59.510
I...

17:00.510 --> 17:03.390
I am Satou, the Ring King!

17:04.620 --> 17:07.670
I came from my world to save yours!

17:08.590 --> 17:11.610
I am your hero!

17:14.270 --> 17:15.180
<i>I...</i>

17:15.180 --> 17:18.770
<i>I think I let things go to my head!</i>

17:23.600 --> 17:24.730
Hime?!

17:25.800 --> 17:27.650
Listen, Satou!

17:27.650 --> 17:29.480
Wh-Wh-Why are you here?!

17:29.480 --> 17:33.360
I didn't have a choice! 
We're technically newlyweds!

17:33.360 --> 17:34.710
Don't look at me!

17:40.610 --> 17:42.950
I'm sorry, Satou.

17:42.950 --> 17:46.790
I knew what would happen 
once I gave you that ring...

17:47.430 --> 17:49.040
Where's this coming from?

17:49.340 --> 17:52.010
This has nothing to do with you,

17:52.510 --> 17:54.120
but I dragged you into it.

17:56.390 --> 17:58.190
I'll be fine.

17:58.190 --> 18:01.120
We <i>are</i> on summer break and all.

18:01.120 --> 18:02.220
And besides...

18:02.760 --> 18:07.060
I'm the Ring King, the husband chosen 
by the Maiden of Light herself.

18:07.520 --> 18:08.300
Right?

18:10.380 --> 18:12.190
Yeah, but...

18:12.480 --> 18:16.440
Also, you have to be here, right?

18:16.900 --> 18:19.880
Yeah, this is my world.

18:19.880 --> 18:21.320
But you're different.

18:21.320 --> 18:23.300
Then I'll stay here, too.

18:24.670 --> 18:28.670
That monster yesterday came 
after you and the ring, right?

18:29.260 --> 18:32.980
If this is something only I can do, 
then I'll stay by your side.

18:37.050 --> 18:38.650
Her hair's so weird.

18:38.650 --> 18:40.680
She's a bad girl!

18:40.680 --> 18:42.100
We should stay away from her.

18:45.720 --> 18:46.930
Satou.

18:48.910 --> 18:50.170
Yeah.

18:51.440 --> 18:53.690
You've always been my hero.

18:54.360 --> 18:55.440
Hm?

18:55.440 --> 18:57.250
It's nothing.

18:57.950 --> 18:59.010
Thanks!

19:04.240 --> 19:05.330
Hey!

19:05.330 --> 19:07.270
S-S-Sorry!

19:07.270 --> 19:09.420
Just so you know,

19:09.420 --> 19:12.710
royal weddings are usually just for show!

19:12.710 --> 19:16.380
And I only picked you on impulse!

19:16.380 --> 19:19.690
You really don't need to take it seriously!

19:21.170 --> 19:23.470
Sure. But you know...

19:24.080 --> 19:27.050
Impulse or not, it made me happy.

19:27.790 --> 19:30.080
I'm glad you picked me.

19:35.480 --> 19:40.220
Gosh, you really like me, huh?

19:41.390 --> 19:42.530
Yeah.

19:43.100 --> 19:46.160
As a friend, right?

19:46.790 --> 19:50.000
Of course, you're very dear to me...

19:51.990 --> 19:53.180
A dear friend.

19:56.150 --> 19:57.430
Oh.

20:01.170 --> 20:02.550
Wh-What's going on?

20:12.460 --> 20:13.880
Ring King.

20:20.840 --> 20:23.280
The Ring King is here!

20:25.240 --> 20:26.460
This way.

20:28.280 --> 20:30.420
Oh, did we interrupt something?

20:30.930 --> 20:32.120
Not yet!

20:32.120 --> 20:33.160
"Yet"?!

20:33.160 --> 20:37.570
Ring King, several monsters 
from the Abyss are attacking.

20:38.700 --> 20:42.200
The one from the other day 
may have been a scout.

20:42.200 --> 20:44.010
Please help us.

20:44.420 --> 20:45.470
Who, me?

20:50.660 --> 20:53.870
No way! Satou doesn't know how to fight!

20:53.870 --> 20:57.270
We still need him to.

20:57.270 --> 21:01.230
So long as he wears that ring, that is.

21:01.620 --> 21:02.440
Okay?

21:02.860 --> 21:04.470
No...

21:07.220 --> 21:10.230
Yeah, I've got you.

21:13.040 --> 21:14.250
Take this.

21:16.970 --> 21:20.170
The Ring of Light repels evil.

21:20.170 --> 21:26.260
It grants you strength and bestows the light 
of purification upon whatever you hold.

21:26.260 --> 21:32.220
In other words, it creates weapons 
that are perfect for defeating the Abyss.

21:32.740 --> 21:35.780
I don't know much about this world.

21:35.780 --> 21:40.190
But I can tell how much it means to you.

21:40.650 --> 21:44.860
And that's reason enough 
to do everything I can!

21:52.210 --> 21:55.470
Go forth, Ring King Satou!

21:55.470 --> 21:59.710
Defeat the evil beings, and save this world!

22:00.580 --> 22:03.320
Go get 'em, honey.

22:04.150 --> 22:05.150
Thanks.

22:07.590 --> 22:09.140
I'll be right back!
